    {
      "bbox": [
        225,
        1373,
        1456,
        1562
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Except as otherwise provided in section 2 of this Emergency Executive Order, for the duration of the local state of emergency, the streets, highways, bridges, and tunnels in the City of New York are closed for vehicular traffic, including but not limited to commercial trucks, electric bicycles, scooters, and mopeds, effective 9 p.m. on Sunday, February 22, 2026, and until 12 p.m. on Monday, February 23, 2026.",
